Found it — `src/styles/theme.css` lines 281-286:

```css
.round-icon{display:grid;width:48px;height:48px;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 4px 5px #004fd02e}
.round-icon-image{width:24px;height:24px}            /* small square image inside */
.round-icon.blue{background:linear-gradient(...)}     /* the colored disc */
.round-icon.orange{...}
.round-icon.green{...}
.round-icon.purple{...}
```

The "色圈" is the tone `background` gradient (48px disc), with the image only 24px inside. To get "image only, circular, same outer size", I'll drop the colored backgrounds, make the image fill the full 48px circle via `object-fit:cover` + `border-radius:50%`, and add `mode="aspectFill"`. Two edits:

Verified: `dist` has **no `.round-icon.blue`** (the colored-disc tone rules are gone), and `object-fit:cover` is in the built CSS. The lingering `2668f5` in source is just other components (`.notice-card`, `.todo-icon`, etc.) — unrelated to the icon. The change is correct and shipped.

## 改动（已重建 dist，build exit 0）

**`src/styles/theme.css`** — 删掉彩色圆盘：
```css
/* 旧：48px 圆盘 + 彩色渐变背景，图片仅 24px 居中 */
.round-icon{...;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 4px 5px #004fd02e}
.round-icon-image{width:24px;height:24px}
.round-icon.blue{background:linear-gradient(...)}   /* 色圈，已删除 */
.round-icon.orange/ green/ purple{...}              /* 已删除 */

/* 新：容器透明无背景，图片铺满 48px 并裁成圆 */
.round-icon{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;background:transparent}
.round-icon-image{width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
```

**`src/pages/systems/index.vue`** — 图标 `<image>` 增加 `mode="aspectFill"`（配合 cover 裁圆）。

效果：外圈彩色块消失，图片本身直接以 **48px 圆形**铺满（与原色圈同直径），`object-fit:cover` 居中裁切不变形。

## 你只需
浏览器**硬刷新** `http://localhost:8091/`：应用列表图标即为圆形图片，无外圈色块。真实模式显示 MinIO 上的 `appLogo`（经 `resolveResourceUrl` 指向 `192.168.1.84`）；演示模式静态图标同样变为圆形。

后端 gateway/portal 仍在运行（支撑接口链），未停止；本轮未提交（你此前已说暂不处理）。
